== About WikiBlueboop ==
'''WikiBlueboop''' is a tribute to the golden age of the web, combining the functionality of Wikipedia with the aesthetic of blueboop.is-a.dev.

=== History ===
Created in 2025 as a solution for Nicholas Tritsaris to have a self-updating, retro-styled wiki.

=== Credits ===
* Theme inspired by: [https://blueboop.is-a.dev blueboop.is-a.dev]
* Created by: Jules (AI Agent)
* Parser: Modified wiky.js

=== Technologies ===
* HTML5
* CSS3 (with lots of gradients!)
* Vanilla JavaScript
* MediaWiki Markdown (Wikitext)
